<title>SPAIN: RALLYING-CATALUNYA RALLY FIRST DAY STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-CATALUNYA RALLY FIRST DAY STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LLORET DE MAR, Spain 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading standings</p>
<p>after the six-stage first day of the three-day Catalunya rally</p>
<p>on Monday:</p>
<p> 1. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza  one hour 56 minutes 13</p>
<p> seconds</p>
<p> 2. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort Cosworth  3 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Freddie Loix (Belgium) Toyota Celica GT4	  5 seconds</p>
<p> 4. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza		6</p>
<p> 5. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer	35</p>
<p> 6. Oriel Gomez (Spain) Renault Megane		 49</p>
<p> 7. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Mitsu Lancer	   50</p>
<p> 8. Richard Burns (Britain) Mitsubishi Lancer    1:15</p>
<p> 9. Patrick Bernardini (France) Ford Escort	1:20</p>
<p> 10. Rui Madeira (Portugal) Toyota Celica GT4    1:38</p>
</text>
